<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>CLAN FESTIVAL 2026 · BANGLADESH CLAN</title>
<meta name="description" content="Official hub for CLAN FESTIVAL 2026 by BANGLADESH CLAN: registration, live leaderboard, scoring, rules and prizes.">
